    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How each pickup is judged, in this order",
      "transparent": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- **Too late:** full (98 % or more) for 2 site hours or longer before the lift. Overflow risk.\n- **Too early:** emptied more than 20 points below that compactor's on-call level. A paid lift for a part-full container.\n- **On time:** neither of the above."
      },
